{"abstract":"Transport of the majority of therapeutic molecules to the brain is precluded by the presence of the blood-brain barrier (BBB) rendering efficient treatment of many neurological disorders impossible. This BBB, nonetheless, may be circumvented by targeting receptors and transport proteins expressed on the luminal surface of the brain capillary endothelial cells (BCECs). The transferrin receptor (TfR) has remained a popular target since its original description for this purpose, although clinical progression of TfR-targeted drug constructs or nanomedicines remains unsuccessful. One proposed issue pertaining to the use of TfR-targeting in nanomedicines is the efficient tuning of the ligand density on the nanoparticle surface. We studied the impact of TfR antibody density on the uptake and transport of nanoparticles into the brain, taking a parallel approach to investigate the impact on both antibody-functionalized gold nanoparticles (AuNPs) and cargo-loaded liposomes. We report that among three different low-range mean ligand densities (0.15, 0.3, and 0.6 ∗ 103 antibodies/μm2), the highest density yielded the highest ability towards both targeting of the BCECs and subsequent transport across the BBB in vivo, and in vitro using primary cultures of the murine BBB. We also find that TfR-targeting on liposomes in the mouse may induce severe adverse effects after intravenous administration.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Johnsen, Kasper Bendix","Bak, Martin","Melander, Fredrik","Thomsen, Maj Schneider","Burkhart, Annette","Kempen, Paul Joseph","Andresen, Thomas Lars","Moos, Torben"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-002880"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Moos, Torben"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modulating the antibody density changes the uptake and transport at the blood brain barrier of both transferrin receptor targeted gold nanoparticles and liposomal cargo","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85059812636&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The work presented in this study was funded by generous grants from the Lundbeck Foundation Research Initiative on Brain Barriers and Drug Delivery (Grant no. R155-2013-14113 ), Fonden til Lægevidenskabens Fremme (Grant no. 14-191 ), and Kong Christian den Tiendes Fond (Grant no. 2016-851/10-0748 ). The authors wish to acknowledge Hanne Krone Nielsen, Laboratory for Neurobiology, Aalborg University for her invaluable technical assistance."],"id":"S02-100.00-002880","identifier":[{"id":"30633947","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85059812636","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3a295b29-84b9-4687-b640-86958fdc8dfe","dtu-58b294f7-aca7-4f04-81dc-813fd97731af"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A41C8EA74B56628C68D49ECEA9F71ACD"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Biomedicine Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Laboratory of Neurobiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kasper Bendix","key":"johnsenpau","last":"Johnsen","locid":"05baea19-a522-4d7d-9beb-95362028aec1","name":"Johnsen, Kasper Bendix","orcid":"0000-0002-1678-2436","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"bakpau","last":"Bak","locid":"faded4ed-8f91-4c3e-8720-c8ab48b00f97","name":"Bak, Martin","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Fredrik","key":"melanderpau","last":"Melander","locid":"582b6d08-2709-43ab-bc41-ba6a144ec7dc","name":"Melander, Fredrik","orcid":"0000-0002-3670-6633","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maj Schneider","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"500ff43a-765e-4d61-9bbd-f228196ed49d","name":"Thomsen, Maj Schneider","orcid":"0000-0002-8385-7039","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Annette","key":"burkhartpau","last":"Burkhart","locid":"7b6bd909-a011-463c-9e09-3623fee043b3","name":"Burkhart, Annette","orcid":"0000-0003-2086-4693","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Paul Joseph","key":"kempenpau","last":"Kempen","locid":"53fd455e-addf-4185-8140-67b0ad1ef465","name":"Kempen, Paul","name_org":"Kempen, Paul Joseph","orcid":"0000-0003-2179-2257","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Lars","key":"andresenpau","last":"Andresen","locid":"4770914a-9162-44d8-8129-7fe13a4dd2de","name":"Andresen, Thomas Lars","orcid