{"abstract":"In Table 5 on page 631, the values for 'Limit values, dry biomass' were shifted to the left. This has now been corrected: there are no values for depth (not applicable) and the values for metal concentrations of As, Cd, and Pb in feed are 40 (10), 1-2, 5-10, respectively, while those for As, Cd, Pb and Hg in sludge are 25, 0.8, 120, and 0.8, respectively. (Footnotes not shown here, unchanged.).","author_count":10,"contributors":["Bruhn, Annette","Tørring, Ditte Bruunshøj","Thomsen, Marianne","Canal-Vergés, Paula","Nielsen, Mette Møller","Rasmussen, Michael Bo","Eybye, Karin Loft","Larsen, Martin Mørk","Balsby, Thorsten Johannes Skovbjerg","Petersen, Jens Kjerulf"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-185003"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Bruhn, Annette"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"erratum impact of environmental conditions on biomass yield quality and bio mitigation capacity of saccharina latissima aquacult environ interact 000000000008 000000002016 000000000619 000000000636 doi 000000000010 000000003354 aei000000000200","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85017194754","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-185003","identifier":[{"id":"85017194754","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-617a6667-a933-4101-afd0-7f5e07d13283"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-99378698E50DBB78911BFC3BB0D0B35F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Marine Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Annette","key":"bruhnpau","last":"Bruhn","locid":"15559017-3036-4e04-968e-338a24d800ce","name":"Bruhn, Annette","orcid":"0000-0002-7940-1338","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ditte Bruunshøj","key":"tørringpau","last":"Tørring","name":"Tørring, Ditte Bruunshøj","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"92402c50-d634-4163-a3fa-198f30c806c5","name":"Thomsen, Marianne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Paula","key":"canalvergéspau","last":"Canal-Vergés","name":"Canal-Vergés, Paula","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Møller","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1204cb45-7359-4c11-9dd9-9eb2e6267dc4","name":"Nielsen, Mette Møller","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael Bo","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"425beba8-a341-4661-bcb1-c84ce6249568","name":"Rasmussen, Michael Bo","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karin Loft","key":"eybyepau","last":"Eybye","locid":"0b97a771-d7b2-4680-9e47-1fd5ff16d8a1","name":"Eybye, Karin Loft","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Mørk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"d24cdbff-3543-4170-b95f-c315ce7477bb","name":"Larsen, Martin Mørk","orcid":"0000-0003-4331-8548","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thorsten Johannes","key":"skovbjergbalsbypau","last":"Skovbjerg Balsby","locid":"b9868bcc-ac9d-4629-b23f-1fadc1207e9c","name":"Balsby, Thorsten Johannes Skovbjerg","name_org":"Skovbjerg Balsby, Thorsten Johannes","orcid":"0000-