{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: During screening for latent tuberculosis infection (LTBI), before anti-tumor-necrosis-factor-a treatment, most patients are already receiving immunosuppressive therapy. The objective was to evaluate the performance of the QuantiFERON Gold In-Tube (QFT-IT) and the Tuberculin Skin Test (TST). METHODS: A prospective multicenter study included 248 patients with ulcerative colitis (39), Crohn's disease (54), rheumatoid arthritis (111), and spondylo-arthropathy (44). RESULTS: QFT-IT was positive in 7/248 (3%), negative in 229 (92%), and indeterminate in 12 (5%). TST was positive in 54/238 (23%) patients. Chest x-ray was suspect for tuberculosis in 5/236 (2%), and 35/167 (21%) had =1 risk-factors for infection with Mycobacterium tuberculosis. The main finding was a pronounced negative effect on QFT-IT and TST performance associated with prednisolone treatment. During prednisolone treatment interferon gamma (IFN-¿) response to mitogen stimulation was impaired (median IFN-¿ response 4.9 IU/mL; interquartile range [IQR] 0.8 to =10.0) compared to patients 1) not receiving corticosteroids (median =10.0; IQR 5.0 to =10.0; P = 0.0015) or 2) receiving long-acting corticosteroids (median >10.0; IQR 9.7 to >10.0; P = 0.0058). Prednisolone treatment was strongly associated with negative TST, adjusted odds ratio (AOR) 0.22 (0.1-0.8; P = 0.018), and with an increased risk of indeterminate QFT-IT results AOR 16.1 (4.1-63.2; P < 0.001), whereas no negative effect was found for long-acting corticosteroids. Doses of =10 mg prednisolone were associated with a 27% risk of indeterminate results. Single use of azathioprine, methotrexate, or 5-aminosalicylate (5-ASA) did not affect the test results. CONCLUSIONS: Oral prednisolone severely suppressed QFT-IT and TST performance, whereas the long-acting corticosteroids methotrexate, azathioprine, and 5-ASA did not have a similar detrimental effect. Patients should be screened for LTBI with QFT-IT or TST prior to initiation of prednisolone therapy and negative QFT-IT or TST results interpreted with caution in patients treated with any corticosteroid until further data are available. (Inflamm Bowel Dis 2011).","author_count":12,"contributors":["Bélard, Erika","Semb, Synne","Ruhwald, Morten","Werlinrud, Anne Marie","Soborg, Bolette","Jensen, Frank Krieger","Thomsen, Henrik","Brylov, Annette","Hetland, Merete Lund","Nordgaard-Lassen, Inge","Ravn, Pernille","Thomsen, Henrik S","Hetland, Merete Lund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-439851"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prednisolone treatment affects the performance of the quantiferon gold in tube test and the tuberculin skin test in patients with autoimmune disorders screened for latent tuberculosis infection","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ibd.21605","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-439851","identifier":[{"id":"21319275","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79953112230","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-4dd06cc0-85b9-4544-a1fc-d8a1e014ea92"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-675847F1D69035C816149C931CF814AD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ibd.21605","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Diagnostic Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Erika","key":"bélarderikapau","last":"Bélard","name":"Bélard, Erika","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Synne","key":"sembsynnepau","last":"Semb","name":"Semb, Synne","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"ruhwaldmortenpau","last":"Ruhwald","name":"Ruhwald, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anne Marie","key":"werlinrudannemariepau","last":"Werlinrud","name":"Werlinrud, Anne Marie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bolette","key":"soborgbolettepau","last":"Soborg","name":"Soborg, Bolette","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Frank Krieger","key":"jensenfrankkriegerpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"670a8465-9887-4c3e-a59c-6b0999ae913f","name":"Jensen, Frank Krieger","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"thomsenhenrikpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Henrik","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Annette","key":"brylovannettepau","last":"Brylov","name":"Brylov, Annette","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Merete Lund","key":"hetlandmeretelundpau","last":"Hetland","name":"Hetland, Merete Lund","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Inge","key":"nordgaardlasseningepau","last":"Nordgaard-Lassen","name":"Nordgaard-Lassen, Inge","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pernille","key":"ravnpernillepau","last":"Ravn","locid":"3f19690c-0d72-4d09-a542-a309efd6fb0a","name":"Ravn, Pernille","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik Segelcke","key":"thomsenhenrikspau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"c1b9dc28-6145-43cc-a1e7-c8a93ab22ec7","name":"Thomsen, Henrik S","name_org":"Thomsen, Henrik Segelcke","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21319275"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/ibd.21605","issn":["10780998","15364844"],"issn_org":["10780998"],"issue":"11","journal":"Inflammatory Bowel Diseases","pages":"2340-2349","status":"p","title":"Inflammatory Bowel Diseases","volume":"17"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79953112230"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-4dd06cc0-85b9-4544-a1fc-d8a1e014ea92"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Prednisolone treatment affects the performance of the QuantiFERON gold in-tube test and the tuberculin skin test in patients with autoimmune disorders screened for latent tuberculosis infection","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-439851","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Early diagnosis of cerebral abscess, which is decisive for the prognosis, is often complicated by the lack of clinical signs. Conventional computed tomography and magnetic resonance imaging cannot always differentiate a cystic or necrotic tumor from an abscess. An abscess is therefore sometimes misdiagnosed as e.g. a glioblastoma or metastasis. Unfortunately, this is sometimes seen at our department and could maybe have been prevented. Diffusion-weighted imaging and apparent diffusion coefficient facilitate differentiation between cerebral tumor and abscess with a sensitivity of 95.2% (76.2-99.9%) and a specificity of 95.7% (78.1-99.9%).","author_count":4,"contributors":["Bang, Casper N","Obel, Annette","Thomsen, Carsten","Obel, Niels"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-520457"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"diffusionsvægtet magnetisk resonans skanning kan skelne abscesser fra tumorer i hjernen","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-520457","identifier":[{"id":"79959580743","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-d493ad33-654e-4b2d-b137-baf5349fffc1"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-59E26D083117DBB3D94343FD1019471A"],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Diagnostic Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Casper N","key":"bangcaspernpau","last":"Bang","name":"Bang, Casper N","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Annette","key":"obelannettepau","last":"Obel","name":"Obel, Annette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten Erik","key":"thomsencarstenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"3df25ea7-9eb3-4b95-9aca-5171b7d5870f","name":"Thomsen, Carsten","name_org":"Thomsen, Carsten Erik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niels","key":"obelnielspau","last":"Obel","locid":"47b44abc-6c99-4a76-b8b0-ca53b033951b","name":"Obel, Niels","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"19","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"1364-6","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","title_org":"Ugeskrift for Laeger","volume":"173"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79959580743"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d493ad33-654e-4b2d-b137-baf5349fffc1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Diffusionsvægtet magnetisk resonans-skanning kan skelne abscesser fra tumorer i hjernen","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-520457","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
